+# Universal `q`-th roots of multiplication pullbacks
+
+For a finite field `K` of cardinality `q = p^k`, every multiplication pullback
+`[q]* z` on `K(E)` is a `q`-th power. The resulting image inclusion in Frobenius
+pullback constructs the dual of Frobenius.
