-`Isogeny.CoordHom`.
+For a separable isogeny `φ` with finite kernel, surjective point map, and projective order
+transport, the multiplicity-free divisor pullback preserves principal divisors and multiplies
+degrees by `#ker φ`. It therefore induces an endomorphism of `Pic⁰(E)`. Transport across the
+Abel–Jacobi isomorphism `κ : Pic⁰(E) ≃+ E` defines the dual point endomorphism
+`δ = κ ∘ φ^* ∘ κ⁻¹`.
 
