-
-This is the reviewer's round-19 point ("for separable φ the σ-bridge is automatic").  Unfolding `δ`
-at `f P`, with `κ⁻¹ (f P) = [(f P) − (O)]`:
-
-  `δ (f P) = κ([φ^*((f P) − (O))]) = σ(φ^*((f P) − (O)))`,
