-for *any* isogeny `φ` over *any* field, given `hgcomm` (per `S`), it produces the full `hcomm'`
-field shape (per `ℓ, S, T`).  Instantiated at `(1 − π)_{K̄}` (`oneSub_hcommPrime_of_hgcomm`) and at
