-  `φ_*φ* = [deg]`), III.3.4 (functoriality of `E ≅ Pic⁰(E)`), III.6.1 (the dual isogeny).
+* [Silverman, *The Arithmetic of Elliptic Curves*], II.3.6–3.7, III.3.4, III.6.1.
 -/
 
